Behaviorally, Soft-coated Wheaten Terriers are known for being friendly, affectionate, and loyal companions. They are generally good with children and other pets, making them excellent family dogs. They are also highly intelligent and can be trained easily, which makes them great working dogs as well. However, they can be stubborn and independent, so training should be consistent and positive.

